State: default

Purpose:
  Define global state symbols used across all .sdd files.
  This is the single source of truth for state symbols.

Symbols:
  +: done
  ~: active
  -: failed
  !: blocked
  ?: decision required
  >: next
  @: reference
  #: task
  =: created
  : : analyzing
  *: review
  ^: superseded
  _: archived
  x: cancelled
  [!]: attention required
  [x]: completed
  [ ]: pending

Stages:
  AN: Analyze
  AR: Architecture
  DB: Database
  BE: Backend
  API: API
  FE: Frontend
  MD: Mobile
  TS: Test
  QA: Quality Assurance
  SC: Security
  DO: DevOps
  VR: Verify

Rules:
  [S1] State symbols MUST be used consistently across all .sdd files.
  [S2] AI MUST update state after completing each stage.
  [S3] State changes MUST be logged in decisions/.

State: +